Template: tacacsrs-agentd/config-source
Type: select
Choices: sonic-configdb, unset
Default: unset
Description: Select the configuration source for tacacsrs-agentd.
 This package records default installation-profile configuration in
 /etc/tacacsrs-agentd/config.ini.
 .
 Select sonic-configdb to get TACACS+ configuration from SONiC CONFIG_DB.
 Select unset to keep the package profile neutral. You can configure the
 profile later.

Template: tacacsrs-agentd/install-sonic-service
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Start the SONiC tacacsrs-agentd systemd service automatically?
 If you enable this option, the package configures and enables
 tacacsrs-agentd.service. The daemon then starts with the SONiC ConfigDB
 service unit.
 .
 To change this selection, run dpkg-reconfigure tacacsrs-agentd.